abstract: >-
  Technical case study of the SolarWinds Orion software supply-chain compromise,
  covering the build compromise, SUNSPOT, SUNBURST, selective victim promotion,
  post-exploitation, identity and cloud activity, detection, remediation,
  ATT&CK mapping, and defensive lessons.
